sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (UI)
    participant C as Client (BlazorWeb / MauiApp)
    participant DB as SQLite (Local)
    participant B as SyncBackgroundWorker
    participant API as SysVet API
    participant CDB as Cloud DB (SQL Server / SQLite dev)

    U->>C: Create/Edit Pet
    C->>DB: Save Pet (Local)
    C->>DB: Add OutboxMessage (same transaction)
    DB-->>C: Saved Locally
    C-->>U: Success (No Network Required)

    loop Every ~30s or connectivity restored
        B->>DB: Read pending OutboxMessages (FIFO, batch up to 50)
        alt Is Online
            B->>API: HTTP POST sync push (payload)
            API->>CDB: Process command (idempotent)
            CDB-->>API: Success
            API-->>B: 200 OK
            B->>DB: Mark OutboxMessage ProcessedAt
        else Is Offline
            B-->>B: Wait next cycle (retain locally)
        end
    end
